<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine is using naval drones to strike Russian warships in Libya’s Benghazi port and launching long-range attacks on Russian targets such as a missile fuel production facility in Tula Oblast, while Russian drones continue to hit Ukrainian energy, rail and civilian sites, injuring children. Kyiv has deployed a new laser weapon that shot down a Russian jet drone, and Russia reported the loss of a 13‑year-old soldier killed in combat. The United Nations Security Council warned that winter attacks on Ukraine’s power grid and Black Sea shipping threaten lives and global food supplies. The conflict caused 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261127-ukraine-submits-black-sea-ceasefire-offer-awaits-russian-response&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/lana-nusseibeh-uae-sudan-un-secretary-general&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/world/middleeast/libya-ukraine-russia-haftar.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168859&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPaWpCbWJkWEZhQXY2d2RLYmFJcXoyUWQxbGF1LTk3dThibG5OemRqRktFVm1vVDFtNUl0Tk45Tko4RENWMGJKU2FEUjF4NFdBdUFUS0dWcl9ZSk5aQ1B5d2g3b0VMUElzWnRwOC1lQlhGOXhWYWVhTUhYdzVESVFaSEg2cmpDMGh1QXR1UEk1dUtfd3N6Y0hLNjRvbE0xVlZVWS1YNGI3NnJEcXVWZG5tN3l3VlpkZm9VUUVTY0lkZmY4V2JP?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQTUkyMENFYnB4cnBoLW05WXZ4dXpPRUphS3NMSUVwRmM3TWJFcjlZRVl1OWdCWlVoUzd2UE5VRk1KbVJzdFZRYUppWExlclRpcmpkMWFMdW5iRlBBUTdQM3ZnbVZjM0FOS2Y1c051c200Szloamc1OUdoYmx4ai1ZeW5fREMxVDdjOVhrdVNZRTVTVGpiLVRZbFo4Vm1KZ